<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-us">
<head>
  <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1B1B1B;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #FAFAFA;
    }
    .email-container {
      background-color: white;
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      padding-bottom: 24px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #E6E6E6;
    }
    .brand {
      color: #0b3d66;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .tagline {
      color: #757575;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #0b3d66;
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .cta-box {
      background-color: #F5F5F5;
      padding: 32px;
      margin: 32px 0;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #E6AF2E;
      color: #1B1B1B;
      padding: 16px 40px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .info-box {
      background-color: #F9F9F9;
      border-left: 4px solid #0b3d66;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .info-box h2 {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #0b3d66;
    }
    .info-box p {
      margin: 8px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid #E6E6E6;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #757575;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer p {
      margin: 8px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="brand">Red Tape LA</div>
      <div class="tagline">Documenting LA's Building Bureaucracy</div>
    </div>

    <h1>Your story is now published</h1>

    <p>Thank you for sharing your experience with LA's building process. Your story about your <%= @report.project_type.presence || "project" %> has been reviewed and approved by our team.</p>

    <% if @report.share_publicly %>
      <p>Because you chose to share your story publicly, it's now visible on our Public Stories page where others facing similar issues can see they're not alone.</p>

      <div class="cta-box">
        <%= link_to "View Your Story", story_url(@report), class: "button", style: "background-color: #E6AF2E; color: #1B1B1B; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; display: inline-block;" %>
      </div>
    <% else %>
      <p>Your story is now part of our database. While you chose not to share it publicly, it's still helping us build the case for reform.</p>
    <% end %>

    <div class="info-box">
      <h2>How your story helps</h2>
      <p><strong>Pattern identification:</strong> We analyze all stories to find common barriers and systemic issues</p>
      <p><strong>Data for advocacy:</strong> We use anonymized, aggregated data in meetings with city officials</p>
      <p><strong>Public reporting:</strong> We publish findings every two months to maintain pressure for reform</p>
    </div>

    <p><strong>Privacy reminder:</strong> Your name and email are never shared. We only use anonymized data when advocating for solutions.</p>

    <p>Thank you for making your story count toward fixing the system.</p>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>Questions? <a href="mailto:john@redtape.la" style="color: #0b3d66;">Email us</a></p>
      <p>Red Tape LA – Building the case for housing reform</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
